    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 1006 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 6 miles north of Longton, or 7 miles east of Howard, moving southeast at 25 mph. HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect wind damage to roofs, siding, and trees. Locations impacted include... Howard, Severy, Fall River, Elk Falls, and Piedmont.",
